{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4f8a111b-d8ab-88f9-99b9-f90d6edbc42b",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:02:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Amara Patel",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:57:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:57:19-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, dear. Oh good, I got a person. I know it's nearly six and City Hall's closed up, so I was calling the storm line number and hoping somebody'd still be sitting there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:57:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm here till the evening shift takes over. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:57:44-05:00",
      "duration": 31,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it's the drain in front of my house. I'm Amara Patel, I'm at 180 Bellevue Avenue. And honey, I have to tell you, this has been going on and on. After that nor'easter that ended Saturday, three days ago now, the grate at the curb has sunk down. It's lower than the pavement around it, and the water goes everywhere but down it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:58:15-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the grate itself has sunk. Let me make sure I have this right. 180 Bellevue Avenue, the storm drain grate at the curb is sitting lower than the road, and water isn't going into it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:58:34-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it exactly. It runs along the curb and spreads out into the lane. There's a big puddle, wide as a car, and it's still sitting there three days later."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:58:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is it still standing water right now, or only when it rains?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:58:56-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right now, dear. I'm looking at it from my front window. It hasn't rained since the weekend and it's still there. And the cars, oh, they slow to a crawl going through it. Everybody's afraid of hitting the dip. Just now there was a line of four of them creeping along, one behind the other."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:59:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's backing up traffic a bit too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:59:28-05:00",
      "duration": 28,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is. And I'm not complaining for the sake of it, you know. In the summer I sit out on my stoop on weekends and watch the tourists go by, I like that, all the people with their cameras. But this is no fun for anybody. Somebody's going to put a tire in that hole and break something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T17:59:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Has this been reported before, that you know of?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:00:02-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd have to say it's been sinking a while, and every storm it gets worse. Nobody has come out to look at it, that I've seen. I've watched out this window and not one truck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:00:20-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'm putting down that the grate has settled below the road surface, there's standing water in the lane, and traffic is slowing through it. I'll send that to the crew that handles drains and road repairs."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:00:38-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, honey. Now, I have to ask you, do the crews work on weekends? Because if it's going to wait for Monday again, I'd like to know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:00:52-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After a storm they do have people out, but I can't tell you who goes where on a weekend. It depends on what else is coming in. I'll flag it so they see it when they're planning the next day's work."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:01:12-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'd appreciate that. It just seems like the little ones get left till last, and the little ones are the ones that keep happening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:01:25-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Let me read back what I've got. Amara Patel, 180 Bellevue Avenue, sunken storm drain grate at the curb, water pooling in the lane since the storm, cars slowing through it. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:01:43-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:01:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And the best number for you is 401-555-0166?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:01:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's my cell, yes. 401-555-0166. I'll pick up if it's the city, even in the evening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:01:59-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. If the crew needs to ask anything, they'll call that number. It'll go out first thing tomorrow morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:02:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, dear. I hope somebody comes out soon. I'll keep an eye on it from the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:02:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for calling, Ms. Patel. Have a good evening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T18:02:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, honey. Goodnight."
    }
  ],
